# 低频词汇 List04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 低频词汇List04核心词汇

{{calculate}}{/ˈkælkjuleɪt/}{计算；估计}{The software calculates the optimal route automatically.}}
{{campus}}{/ˈkæmpəs/}{校园；大学}{The campus covers over 200 acres of land.}}
{{cancel}}{/ˈkænsl/}{取消；撤销}{The event was cancelled due to unforeseen circumstances.}}
{{capital}}{/ˈkæpɪtl/}{资本；首都}{The company raised venture capital to fund its growth.}}
{{caption}}{/ˈkæpʃn/}{标题；字幕}{Each image has a descriptive caption for accessibility.}}
{{carbon}}{/ˈkɑːbən/}{碳；复写纸}{Carbon neutrality is a key goal for many corporations.}}
{{cargo}}{/ˈkɑːɡəʊ/}{货物；船货}{The cargo ship arrived at the port early in the morning.}}
{{carve}}{/kɑːv/}{雕刻；切割}{The artist carved intricate designs into the wooden panel.}}
{{casualty}}{/ˈkæʒuəlti/}{伤亡人员}{The natural disaster caused significant casualties.}}
{{catalog}}{/ˈkætəlɒɡ/}{目录；产品手册}{The library's catalog is fully searchable online.}}
{{catastrophe}}{/kəˈtæstrəfi/}{灾难；大祸}{The drought was an agricultural catastrophe for the region.}}
{{census}}{/ˈsensəs/}{人口普查}{The census data reveals shifting demographic trends.}}
{{certify}}{/ˈsɜːtɪfaɪ/}{证明；认证}{The laboratory is certified to conduct safety tests.}}
{{chamber}}{/ˈtʃeɪmbər/}{房间；议院}{The proposal was debated in the lower chamber of parliament.}}
{{chancellor}}{/ˈtʃɑːnsələr/}{总理；校长}{The chancellor announced a new scholarship program.}}
{{chaos}}{/ˈkeɪɒs/}{混乱；混沌}{The sudden resignation threw the office into chaos.}}
{{characteristic}}{/ˌkærəktəˈrɪstɪk/}{特征；特性}{Adaptability is a key characteristic of successful leaders.}}
{{charter}}{/ˈtʃɑːtər/}{宪章；包租}{The organization operates under a formal charter.}}
{{chase}}{/tʃeɪs/}{追逐；追赶}{The company is chasing new markets in Southeast Asia.}}
{{cherish}}{/ˈtʃerɪʃ/}{珍爱；怀念}{She cherishes every moment spent with her family.}}
{{chip}}{/tʃɪp/}{芯片；碎片}{The shortage of computer chips disrupted global supply chains.}}
{{chorus}}{/ˈkɔːrəs/}{合唱；合唱队}{The audience joined in the chorus at the end of the concert.}}
{{chronic}}{/ˈkrɒnɪk/}{慢性的；长期的}{Chronic pain affects millions of people worldwide.}}
{{cipher}}{/ˈsaɪfər/}{密码；零}{The message was encoded using an ancient cipher.}}
{{civilian}}{/sɪˈvɪliən/}{平民；民用的}{The ceasefire was intended to protect civilian lives.}}
{{clamp}}{/klæmp/}{夹子；钳制}{Authorities clamped down on illegal trading activities.}}
{{classify}}{/ˈklæsɪfaɪ/}{分类；归类}{The species was classified as critically endangered.}}
{{clause}}{/klɔːz/}{条款；从句}{The clause allows for early termination of the contract.}}
{{clinical}}{/ˈklɪnɪkl/}{临床的；冷静的}{Clinical evidence supports the effectiveness of the treatment.}}
{{clone}}{/kləʊn/}{克隆；复制品}{Scientists successfully cloned the endangered animal.}}
